### 5.5 What the Existing Codebase Keeps Unchanged

- `src/phase.rs` — Phase definitions, parsing
- `src/forge_config.rs` — Config loading (extended with `[runtime]` section)
- `src/dag/scheduler.rs` — DAG computation, wave ordering
- `src/review/` — Specialist definitions (they become agent profiles)
- `src/factory/api.rs`, `server.rs`, `ws.rs` — Factory API (connects to daemon for execution)
- `src/factory/db/` — Factory database (unchanged)
- `src/orchestrator/state.rs` — Orchestration state (complemented by daemon state)
- `ui/` — React frontend (extended with runtime observability views)

